  <entry>
    <title type="html">LoRDO at ICML 2026</title>
    <link href="https://philippwiesner.org/camlsys-preview/news/2026-07-08-lordo-icml/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="LoRDO at ICML 2026"/>
    <published>2026-07-08T00:00:00+00:00</published>
    <updated>2026-07-08T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
    <id>https://philippwiesner.org/camlsys-preview/news/lordo-icml</id>
    <content type="html" xml:base="https://philippwiesner.org/camlsys-preview/news/2026-07-08-lordo-icml/"><![CDATA[]]></content>
    <author>
      <name/>
    </author>
    <summary type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Our paper <a href="https://philippwiesner.org/camlsys-preview/publications/jovanovic2026-lordo/">LoRDO</a> was presented at ICML in Seoul. It combines low-rank optimization with infrequent communication to support wide-area distributed training.</p>
]]></summary>
